The '''Driptoad Delve''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Driptoad Delve''' is a large pool of water with frogspawn scattered across the surface. A hole at the bottom leads to the {{zone|Driptoad Pass}}.

